p("La Wii habla directo","The Wii talks to Twitch directly over HTTPS, ","La Wii parle directement à Twitch en HTTPS, ","Die Wii spricht direkt per HTTPS mit Twitch, ","La Wii parla direttamente con Twitch via HTTPS, ","De Wii praat rechtstreeks met Twitch via HTTPS, ","O Wii fala direto com a Twitch por HTTPS, ")
p("con miniaturas, avatares, box art, banners","with thumbnails, avatars, box art, banners, public VODs and anonymous TCP/TLS/WSS chat. VODs play from the start, with no seek/resume. It tolerates a few minutes of clock difference and keeps the approximate date correct.\n\n","avec miniatures, avatars, jaquettes, bannières, VOD publiques et chat anonyme TCP/TLS/WSS. VOD depuis le début, sans seek/reprise. Tolère quelques minutes d'écart d'horloge et conserve la date approximative correcte.\n\n","mit Vorschaubildern, Avataren, Box-Art, Bannern, öffentlichen VODs und anonymem TCP/TLS/WSS-Chat. VODs laufen ab Anfang, ohne Spulen/Fortsetzen. Toleriert einige Minuten Uhrabweichung und behält das ungefähre Datum bei.\n\n","con miniature, avatar, box art, banner, VOD pubblici e chat anonima TCP/TLS/WSS. I VOD partono dall'inizio, senza seek/ripresa. Tollera alcuni minuti di differenza dell'orologio e mantiene corretta la data approssimativa.\n\n","met miniaturen, avatars, boxart, banners, openbare VOD's en anonieme TCP/TLS/WSS-chat. VOD's starten vanaf het begin, zonder spoelen/hervatten. Tolereert enkele minuten klokverschil en houdt de datum bij benadering correct.\n\n","com miniaturas, avatares, capas, banners, VODs públicos e chat anônimo TCP/TLS/WSS. VODs começam do início, sem seek/retomar. Tolera alguns minutos de diferença no relógio e mantém a data aproximada correta.\n\n")
